abstract: >-
  Deterministic astronomical (Swiss Ephemeris pyswisseph, < 1.5 ms execution,
  Zero-Auth, Rule 14 Zero-Knowledge Privacy) and 7-Wisdoms ephemeris oracle
  uniting Tropical Astronomy, Mayan Tzolkin (260-day count), Vedic Sidereal
  Jyotish (Lahiri Ayanamsa, 27 Nakshatras), Chinese Bazi & Wu Xing, 64 I-Ching
  Hexagrams, 72 Kabbalistic Shem HaMephorash Angels & Tree of Life Sephiroth,
  and Pythagorean Numerology. Includes the HU-DIAMOND · Fil d'Or v1.1 non-coercion
  protocol (7 Hard Laws L1..L7, c_levels == 1), The Diamond Forge (/oracle/diamond &
  /api/sfumato/diamond-budget: Stella Octangula in Q^3, Reed-Muller RM(1,3) antipodal
  code, 1..4 Spiral Turns -> 9..36 Deep Think calls & AST Kintsugi verifier), and the
  HU-SOVEREIGN-SHIELD v1.0
  & HU-SOVEREIGN-BEACON engine (/api/sfumato/sovereign-shield: RFC 6962 Certificate
  Transparency Merkle Audit Trees, Three-Ring Zero-Knowledge Dignity Receipts, and
  Persephone & Demeter Exact Rational Solidarity Algebra). Speaks the Linux Foundation
  / AAIF Agent2Agent (lf.a2a.v1 v1.0.0 & v0.3.0 with RFC 8785 JCS + RFC 7515 ES256 JWS
  signatures) and Model Context Protocol (MCP 2026-07-28). Awarded Linux Foundation
  OpenSSF Best Practices Gold Badge (#16118 — 300% tiered) and Glama TDQS Grade A.
